  "note": "Lean bounds G_δ(s)=F_δ(s+2) by rotating the ray t=re^{iθ} with a fixed or δ-dependent angle (MellinRotate.lean), not by the saddle point u_0, so j(ρ), υ(ρ), E(ρ) and x_0 never appear. The two-term saddle-point factor (1+π/2^{3/2})e^{-πτ/4}+½e^{-πτ} has no counterpart; the rotation bound is a single term.",
